			(
    			type = plaintext
				value = "<div style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; color: rgb(18, 19, 43); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240)\" class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\"><div style=\"font-family: Lato, sans-serif\">ITK CAREERS – APPLICANT TERMS AND CONDITIONS<br /></div><div style=\"font-family: Lato, sans-serif\">Role: Software Developer<br /></div></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; color: rgb(18, 19, 43); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240)\" class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\">By submitting your application through this form, you agree to the following terms:<br /></div><ol style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; margin: 0px; padding-top: inherit; padding-right: inherit; padding-bottom: inherit; padding-left: 20px; list-style: decimal; color: rgb(18, 19, 43); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240)\" class=\"T9WCjf qkgVBf\"><li style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240)\" class=\"Z1qcYe\"><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240)\" class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\"><div style=\"font-family: Lato, sans-serif\">Accuracy of Information<br /></div><div style=\"font-family: Lato, sans-serif\">You certify that all information, resumes, portfolios, and code samples provided in this application are true, accurate, and complete. Providing false, misleading, or plagiarized information (including AI-generated code represented as original work) will result in immediate disqualification or termination of employment if hired.<br /></div></div></li><li style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240)\" class=\"Z1qcYe\"><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240)\" class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\"><div style=\"font-family: Lato, sans-serif\">Background and Reference Checks<br /></div><div style=\"font-family: Lato, sans-serif\">You authorize ITK Careers to verify the information provided in this application. This includes contacting listed references, previous employers, and educational institutions, as well as conducting background and technical qualification verifications where permitted by law.<br /></div></div></li><li style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240)\" class=\"Z1qcYe\"><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240)\" class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\"><div style=\"font-family: Lato, sans-serif\">Submission of Code Samples and Assessments<br /></div><div style=\"font-family: Lato, sans-serif\">Any code, technical tasks, or project assignments submitted during this application process must be your own original work.<br /></div></div></li></ol><ul style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; list-style: inherit; margin: 12px 0px 16px; padding-top: inherit; padding-right: inherit; padding-bottom: inherit; padding-left: 20px; color: rgb(18, 19, 43); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240)\" class=\"KsbFXc U6u95\"><li style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240)\" class=\"Z1qcYe\"><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240)\" class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\">You retain the intellectual property rights to your original code.<br /></div></li><li style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240)\" class=\"Z1qcYe\"><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240)\" class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\">However, ITK Careers reserves the right to review, test, and run your submissions through automated plagiarism and code-evaluation tools.<br /></div></li><li style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240)\" class=\"Z1qcYe\"><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240)\" class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\">ITK Careers is not obligated to provide detailed feedback on technical assessments.<br /></div></li></ul><ol style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; margin: 0px; padding-top: inherit; padding-right: inherit; padding-bottom: inherit; padding-left: 20px; list-style: decimal; color: rgb(18, 19, 43); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240)\" class=\"T9WCjf qkgVBf\"><li style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240)\" class=\"Z1qcYe\"><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240)\" class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\"><div style=\"font-family: Lato, sans-serif\">Data Privacy and Processing<br /></div><div style=\"font-family: Lato, sans-serif\">By submitting this form, you consent to ITK Careers collecting, storing, and processing your personal data, contact details, employment history, and technical profiles (such as GitHub or LinkedIn). This data will be used solely for recruitment, interview scheduling, and candidate evaluation purposes in accordance with our Privacy Policy.<br /></div></div></li><li style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240)\" class=\"Z1qcYe\"><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240)\" class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\"><div style=\"font-family: Lato, sans-serif\">No Guarantee of Employment<br /></div><div style=\"font-family: Lato, sans-serif\">Submitting this application, participating in interviews, or completing technical assessments does not constitute an offer of employment or a guarantee of future placement with ITK Careers.<br /></div></div></li><li style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240)\" class=\"Z1qcYe\"><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(230, 232, 240)\" class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\"><div style=\"font-family: Lato, sans-serif\">Confidentiality<br /></div><div style=\"font-family: Lato, sans-serif\">During the recruitment process, you may receive proprietary information, technical challenges, or insights into ITK Careers' internal systems. You agree to keep all such interview materials, coding prompts, and company details strictly confidential and will not share them publicly or online<br /></div></div></li></ol><div><br /></div>"
	 			row = 8
	 			column = 1   
				width = medium
			)
			I_would_like_to_receive_notifications_email_alerts_and_updates_about_future_career_opportunities_a
			(
    			type = checkbox
				displayname = "I would like to receive notifications, email alerts, and updates about future career opportunities and relevant job openings at ITK Careers."
				initial value = false
	 			row = 8
	 			column = 1   
				width = medium
			)
			must have I_hereby_declare_that_all_the_information_provided_in_this_application_form_is_true_accurate_and_c
			(
    			type = checkbox
				displayname = "I hereby declare that all the information provided in this application form is true, accurate, and complete to the best of my knowledge."
				initial value = false
	 			row = 8
	 			column = 1   
				width = medium
			)
			must have I_have_read_understood_and_agree_to_the_ITK_Careers_Applicant_Terms_and_Conditions_and_Privacy_Pol
			(
    			type = checkbox
				displayname = "I have read, understood, and agree to the ITK Careers Applicant Terms and Conditions and Privacy Policy"
				initial value = false
	 			row = 8
	 			column = 1   
				width = medium
			)
	
			actions
			{
				on add
				{
					submit
					(
   						type = submit
   						displayname = "Submit"
					)
				}
				on edit
				{
					update
					(
   						type = submit
   						displayname = "Update"
					)
					cancel
					(
   						type = cancel
   						displayname = "Cancel"
					)
				}
			}
		}
	}
	reports
	{
		default list Registration_Form_Report
		{
			displayName = "Registration Form Report"
			show all rows from Registration_Form    
			(
				Name 
				Gender
				DOB
				Address 
	 			(
	      			enable = Link_to_Map,Show_As_Text
	 			)
				Gmail
				Contact
				(
					displayformat = plainnumber
				)
				Academics.Education as "Academics"
				I_declare_that_the_my_First_Name_Last_Name_Date_Of_Birth_are_as_per_Aadhar as "I declare that the my First Name, Last Name & Date Of Birth are as per Aadhar."
				I_would_like_to_receive_notifications_email_alerts_and_updates_about_future_career_opportunities_a as "I would like to receive notifications, email alerts, and updates about future career opportunities and relevant job openings at ITK Careers."
				I_hereby_declare_that_all_the_information_provided_in_this_application_form_is_true_accurate_and_c as "I hereby declare that all the information provided in this application form is true, accurate, and complete to the best of my knowledge."
				I_have_read_understood_and_agree_to_the_ITK_Careers_Applicant_Terms_and_Conditions_and_Privacy_Pol as "I have read, understood, and agree to the ITK Careers Applicant Terms and Conditions and Privacy Policy"
				Resume
				Additional_Documents as "Additional Documents"
				Projects.S_No as "Projects"
				Intership_Experience.S_No as "Intership Experience"
				Do_you_have_any_Internship_Experience as "Do you have any Internship Experience?"
				custom action "Schedule Interview"
				(
	  			workflow = Schedule_1st_round
				show action in edit record menu = true
				column header = "Schedule Interview"
				)
				Interview_Roles as "Interview Roles"
				Multi_LineSs as "Describe you are fit for this Role"
			)

		}
		map Applicant_Location
		{
			displayName = "Applicant Location"
			show all rows from Registration_Form    
			(
				Name 
				Gender
				DOB
				Address 
	 			(
	      			enable = Link_to_Map,Show_As_Text
	 			)
				Gmail
				Contact
				(
					displayformat = plainnumber
				)
				I_declare_that_the_my_First_Name_Last_Name_Date_Of_Birth_are_as_per_Aadhar as "I declare that the my First Name, Last Name & Date Of Birth are as per Aadhar."
				Do_you_have_any_Internship_Experience as "Do you have any Internship Experience?"
				Resume
				Additional_Documents as "Additional Documents"
				I_would_like_to_receive_notifications_email_alerts_and_updates_about_future_career_opportunities_a as "I would like to receive notifications, email alerts, and updates about future career opportunities and relevant job openings at ITK Careers."
				I_hereby_declare_that_all_the_information_provided_in_this_application_form_is_true_accurate_and_c as "I hereby declare that all the information provided in this application form is true, accurate, and complete to the best of my knowledge."
				I_have_read_understood_and_agree_to_the_ITK_Careers_Applicant_Terms_and_Conditions_and_Privacy_Pol as "I have read, understood, and agree to the ITK Careers Applicant Terms and Conditions and Privacy Policy"
			)

			options
			(
	 			display field = Address
	 		)
		}
		default list All_Masters
		{
			displayName = "All Masters"
			show all rows from Master    
			(
				ITK_Careers  as "ITK Careers"
				Image
			)

		}
		default list All_Company_Masters
		{
			displayName = "All Company Masters"
			show all rows from Company_Master    
			(
				ITK_Careers as "Company Name"
				Website
				Industry
				Company_Address  as "Company Address"
	 			(
	      			enable = Link_to_Map,Show_As_Text
	 			)
				Contact_Email as "Contact Email"
				Phone_Number1 as "Phone Number"
				(
					displayformat = plainnumber
				)
			)

		}
		default list All_Interview_Rounds_Masters
		{
			displayName = "All Interview Rounds Masters"
			show all rows from Interview_Rounds_Master    
			(
				Round_Name as "Round Name"
				Round_Order as "Round Order"
				ID
			)

			sort by
			(
				Round_Order ascending
			)
		}
		default list Application_Status_and_Information_Tracker_Report
		{
			displayName = "Application Status and Information Tracker Report"
			show all rows from Application_Status_and_Information_Tracker    
			(
				Applicant
				Interview_Round as "Interview Round"
				Round_Score as "Round Score"
				Round_Status as "Round Status"
				Iterviewer_Comments as "Interviewer Comments"
			)

		}
		default list All_Interview_Schedules
		{
			displayName = "All Interview Schedules"
			show all rows from Interview_Schedule    
			(
				Applicant
				Round_Name as "Round Name"
				Interview_Start as "Interview Start"
				Interview_End as "Interview End"
				Schedule_Status as "Schedule Status"
				custom action "Validate"
				(
	  			workflow = Validate_Workflow
				show action in edit record menu = true
				column header = "Validate"
				condition = (Schedule_Status == "Scheduled")
				)
				custom action "Schedule Interview"
				(
	  			workflow = Schedule_Interview
				show action in edit record menu = true
				column header = "Schedule Interview"
				condition = (Previous_Round_Status.Round_Status == "Shortlisted to Next Round")
				)
				Previous_Round_Status as "Previous Round Status"
				(
					view = Application_Status_and_Information_Tracker_Report
				)
			)

		}
		default list All_Employees1
		{
			displayName = "All Employees"
			show all rows from Employees1    
			(
				Employee_Name  as "Employee Name"
				Email
				Phone_Number as "Phone"
				(
					displayformat = plainnumber
				)
				Role
				Date_of_Joining as " Date of Joining"
				Software_Developer_Registration_Form as "Registration Form"
			)

		}
		default list All_Interview_Roles
		{
			displayName = "All Interview Roles"
			show all rows from Interview_Roles    
			(
				S_No as "S.No:"
				Roles
			)

		}
	}
	pages
	{
		page Application_Dasboard
		{
			displayname = "Application Dasboard"
			Content="<zml    \t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n>\n\t<layout>\n\t<row>\n\t<column\n   \t\t width='100%'\n   \t>\n\t<dsp id='html_snippet1' elementName='HTML Snippet 1'\n bgColor=\"#FFFFFF\" \n>\n\t<![CDATA[htmlpage html_snippet1()\ncontent\n&lt;%{\n\t%&gt;\n&lt;div style=&quot;\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3a8a 0%, #0284c7 100%);\n  border-radius: 14px;\n  padding: 26px 32px;\n  margin-bottom: 22px;\n  color: #ffffff;\n  font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &apos;Segoe UI&apos;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n  box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.25);\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 20px;\n&quot;&gt;\n\n  &lt;!-- Left: Branding &amp; Tagline --&gt;\n  &lt;div style=&quot;flex: 1 1 360px;&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 6px;&quot;&gt;\n      &lt;span style=&quot;\n        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);\n        padding: 8px 12px;\n        border-radius: 10px;\n        font-size: 22px;\n        backdrop-filter: blur(4px);\n      &quot;&gt;\uD83D\uDE80&lt;/span&gt;\n      &lt;h1 style=&quot;margin: 0; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.5px; color: #ffffff;&quot;&gt;\n        ITK Careers &amp; Talent Acquisition\n      &lt;/h1&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0 0 14px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #e0f2fe; line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;\n      Welcome to the central Software Developer recruitment portal. Track candidate progression, manage interview rounds, and onboard top-tier tech talent seamlessly.\n    &lt;/p&gt;\n\n    &lt;!-- Company Quick Highlights --&gt;\n    &lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap;&quot;&gt;\n      &lt;span style=&quot;background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15); padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;\n        \uD83D\uDCCD Chennai\n      &lt;/span&gt;\n      &lt;span style=&quot;background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15); padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500;&quot;&gt;\n        \uD83D\uDCBC Tech &amp; Engineering Division\n      &lt;/span&gt;\n      &lt;span style=&quot;background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.25); border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.5); color: #a7f3d0; padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;\n        \u25CF Active Recruitment Drive\n      &lt;/span&gt;\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n\n  &lt;!-- Right: Quick Portal Stats / Action Box --&gt;\n  &lt;div style=&quot;\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    padding: 16px 22px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 8px;\n    min-width: 220px;\n    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);\n  &quot;&gt;\n    &lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 12px; color: #bae6fd; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.5px;&quot;&gt;\n      Recruiter Quick Links\n    &lt;/div&gt;\n    &lt;a href=&quot;#Form:Software_Developer_Registration_Form&quot; target=&quot;_self&quot; style=&quot;\n      background: #ffffff;\n      color: #0369a1;\n      text-decoration: none;\n      padding: 7px 14px;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      text-align: center;\n      transition: all 0.2s;\n      display: inline-block;\n    &quot;&gt;\n      + New Candidate Registration\n    &lt;/a&gt;\n\n  &lt;/div&gt;\n\n&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;%\n\n}%&gt;]]>\n</dsp>\n</column>\n</row><row>\n\t<column\n   \t\t width='38%'\n   \t>\n\t<panel elementName='Panel 1'\n \n >\n\t<pr \n\t\t\twidth='fill'\n\t\theight='fill'\n>\n\t<pc \n\t\tpadding = '20px'\n\tbgColor = '#FFFFFF'\n\n\t\twidth = '100%'\n\t\thAlign = 'center'\n\t\tvAlign = 'middle'\n>\n\t<pr \n\t\t\twidth='auto'\n\t\theight='auto'\n>\n\t<pc \n\t\tpadding = '5px'\n\n>\n\t<pr \n\t>\n\t<pc \n\t\n>\n\t<text \n\n\tmarginLeft = '0px'\n